msgstr "The DOI is not in a valid format (it must start with 10.xxxx/, e.g. 10.1234/abc.2026.1)."

msgid "plugins.generic.issueApiWrite.doi.duplicate"
msgstr "That DOI is already assigned to another object in this journal."
